          <img class="brand-mark" src="/assets/logo.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" />
          Xonus
        </a>
        <p>
          A Gemini-native decision engine with log-odds early stopping and an answer-mass
          quality gate. Built to be dropped into every project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Product</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#features">Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#how">How it works</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#gate">Quality gate</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Developers</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/docs#installation">Installation</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs#quickstart">Quickstart</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs#decide">API reference</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs#tuning">Tuning</a></li>
        </ul>
